; Score for the first visit to a location (14 records)
;
; Records of 3 bytes: location id, score value (word, in tenths of a per cent);
; FF ends. When the player first arrives at a location (#R$8E12 marks it with
; LOC_VISITED), the location is looked up with #R$9DBD and its value is added
; to the score ($B6F7).
@label=FirstVisitScores
